  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "Why is a wind-turbine maker building",
      "start": 0.29,
      "end": 3.16,
      "shot": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "an AI data centre?",
      "start": 3.16,
      "end": 4.42,
      "shot": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "In Inner Mongolia, Envision is connecting",
      "start": 4.65,
      "end": 7.28,
      "shot": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "those businesses through an AI campus",
      "start": 7.28,
      "end": 9.040000000000001,
      "shot": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "called Galaxy.",
      "start": 9.55,
      "end": 10.68,
      "shot": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow the electricity to understand why",
      "start": 10.89,
      "end": 13.31,
      "shot": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "an energy company wants to build",
      "start": 13.31,
      "end": 15.51,
      "shot": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "it.",
      "start": 15.51,
      "end": 15.88,
      "shot": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Envision founder and CEO Lei Zhang",
      "start": 16,
      "end": 18.8,
      "shot": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "started the company in 2007, making",
      "start": 18.8,
      "end": 21.52,
      "shot": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "wind turbines.",
      "start": 21.52,
      "end": 22.45,
      "shot": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "It expanded into batteries and energy",
      "start": 22.45,
      "end": 24.889999999999997,
      "shot": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "systems.",
      "start": 24.91,
      "end": 25.799999999999997,
      "shot": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Computing creates demand for that equipment.",
      "start": 26.01,
      "end": 28.77,
      "shot": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Ulanqab sits about 300 kilometres northwest",
      "start": 28.77,
      "end": 31.82,
      "shot": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "of Beijing, in China's Inner Mongolia.",
      "start": 31.82,
      "end": 34.44,
      "shot": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "SemiAnalysis visited in September 2026.",
      "start": 34.64,
      "end": 37.64,
      "shot": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Its report is the starting point",
      "start": 37.64,
      "end": 39.47,
      "shot": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "for this story.",
      "start": 39.47,
      "end": 40.629999999999995,
      "shot": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "OpenAI's Stargate is the American comparison.",
      "start": 40.85,
      "end": 44.36,
      "shot": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Galaxy is a separate Envision project.",
      "start": 44.57,
      "end": 47.16,
      "shot": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "SemiAnalysis reports 120 megawatts delivered in",
      "start": 47.37,
      "end": 50.61,
      "shot": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "August, within a year.",
      "start": 50.61,
      "end": 52.199999999999996,
      "shot": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Here, IT capacity means power intended",
      "start": 52.4,
      "end": 54.57,
      "shot": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "for servers and other computing equipment.",
      "start": 54.59,
      "end": 57.4,
      "shot": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "The report puts the full campus",
      "start": 57.4,
      "end": 59.26,
      "shot": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "plan at 800 megawatts of IT",
      "start": 59.26,
      "end": 61.26,
      "shot": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "capacity.",
      "start": 61.26,
      "end": 62.17,
      "shot": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "A delivered phase and a future",
      "start": 62.17,
      "end": 63.79,
      "shot": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "plan are different milestones.",
      "start": 63.79,
      "end": 65.7,
      "shot": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "That distinction matters.",
      "start": 65.7,
      "end": 67.39999999999999,
      "shot": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Capacity alone cannot tell us how",
      "start": 67.61,
      "end": 69.41,
      "shot": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "much useful AI computing is actually",
      "start": 69.41,
      "end": 71.61,
      "shot": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "taking place.",
      "start": 71.61,
      "end": 72.84,
      "shot": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Accelerators process data, with memory and",
      "start": 73.09,
      "end": 75.62,
      "shot": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "networks keeping them supplied.",
      "start": 75.62,
      "end": 77.64,
      "shot": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Power must reach those racks reliably.",
      "start": 77.85,
      "end": 80.2,
      "shot": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "Their heat also has to leave",
      "start": 80.41,
      "end": 81.67,
      "shot": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "the building.",
      "start": 81.67,
      "end": 82.76,
      "shot": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "SemiAnalysis describes a five-megawatt pilot testing",
      "start": 82.94,
      "end": 85.75,
      "shot": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "a different way of supplying the",
      "start": 85.75,
      "end": 87.59,
      "shot": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "racks.",
      "start": 87.59,
      "end": 88.2,
      "shot": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Solid-state transformers convert incoming alternating current",
      "start": 88.45,
      "end": 92,
      "shot": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "into an 800-volt direct-current bus.",
      "start": 92,
      "end": 94.89,
      "shot": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "At the same power, doubling DC",
      "start": 94.89,
      "end": 96.8,
      "shot": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "voltage halves the current in a",
      "start": 96.8,
      "end": 98.68,
      "shot": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "conductor.",
      "start": 98.68,
      "end": 99.61,
      "shot": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "At the same resistance, lower current",
      "start": 99.61,
      "end": 101.79,
      "shot": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "reduces heating losses.",
      "start": 101.79,
      "end": 103.41,
      "shot": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Galaxy's actual savings need measuring.",
      "start": 103.65,
      "end": 106.08,
      "shot": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Rack electronics still reduce voltage further",
      "start": 106.08,
      "end": 108.59,
      "shot": 20
    },
    {
      "text": "before that power reaches the chips.",
      "start": 108.59,
      "end": 110.73,
      "shot": 20
    },
    {
      "text": "Envision also makes turbines and batteries,",
      "start": 110.73,
      "end": 113.72,
      "shot": 21
    },
    {
      "text": "extending its role beyond owning the",
      "start": 113.72,
      "end": 115.68,
      "shot": 21
    },
    {
      "text": "building.",
      "start": 115.68,
      "end": 116.4,
      "shot": 21
    },
    {
      "text": "The company can coordinate generation, storage",
      "start": 116.4,
      "end": 119.12,
      "shot": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "and equipment supplying power inside the",
      "start": 119.12,
      "end": 121.37,
      "shot": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "campus.",
      "start": 121.37,
      "end": 122,
      "shot": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "But a wind farm's rated power",
      "start": 122,
      "end": 123.92,
      "shot": 23
    },
    {
      "text": "is not its output at every",
      "start": 123.92,
      "end": 125.59,
      "shot": 23
    },
    {
      "text": "moment.",
      "start": 125.59,
      "end": 126.39999999999999,
      "shot": 23
    },
    {
      "text": "The wind rises and falls.",
      "start": 126.69,
      "end": 128.85000000000002,
      "shot": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "Computing equipment needs reliable power through",
      "start": 129.09,
      "end": 131.77,
      "shot": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "those changes.",
      "start": 131.77,
      "end": 132.81,
      "shot": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "Batteries store some surplus electricity and",
      "start": 132.81,
      "end": 135.77,
      "shot": 25
    },
    {
      "text": "supply it when generation falls below",
      "start": 135.77,
      "end": 138.3,
      "shot": 25
    },
    {
      "text": "demand.",
      "start": 138.3,
      "end": 139.12,
      "shot": 25
    },
    {
      "text": "Their usefulness depends on power, stored",
      "start": 139.33,
      "end": 142.37,
      "shot": 26
    },
    {
      "text": "energy, and how long the calm",
      "start": 142.37,
      "end": 144.44,
      "shot": 26
    },
    {
      "text": "lasts.",
      "start": 144.44,
      "end": 145.28,
      "shot": 26
    },
    {
      "text": "'Wind-powered' does not establish that wind",
      "start": 145.49,
      "end": 147.98,
      "shot": 27
    },
    {
      "text": "supplies all the electricity, every hour.",
      "start": 147.98,
      "end": 150.96,
      "shot": 27
    },
    {
      "text": "How much of Galaxy is fitted",
      "start": 150.96,
      "end": 152.82,
      "shot": 28
    },
    {
      "text": "with hardware and actually running remains",
      "start": 152.82,
      "end": 155.36,
      "shot": 28
    },
    {
      "text": "unverified.",
      "start": 155.87,
      "end": 156.88000000000002,
      "shot": 28
    },
    {
      "text": "Reported delivered capacity is not a",
      "start": 157.25,
      "end": 159.43,
      "shot": 29
    },
    {
      "text": "measurement of load drawn by working",
      "start": 159.43,
      "end": 161.87,
      "shot": 29
    },
    {
      "text": "servers.",
      "start": 161.87,
      "end": 162.8,
      "shot": 29
    },
    {
      "text": "Buildings and megawatts cannot confirm installed",
      "start": 163.01,
      "end": 165.91,
      "shot": 30
    },
    {
      "text": "chips, or how much work they",
      "start": 165.91,
      "end": 167.85,
      "shot": 30
    },
    {
      "text": "produce.",
      "start": 167.85,
      "end": 168.64000000000001,
      "shot": 30
    },
    {
      "text": "Envision's larger capacity announcements also need",
      "start": 168.81,
      "end": 172.08,
      "shot": 31
    },
    {
      "text": "reconciling with SemiAnalysis's description of the",
      "start": 172.08,
      "end": 175.25,
      "shot": 31
    },
    {
      "text": "campus.",
      "start": 175.27,
      "end": 176.08,
      "shot": 31
    },
    {
      "text": "Those are questions for Zhang and",
      "start": 176.29,
      "end": 177.86,
      "shot": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "the site's engineers, alongside the wider",
      "start": 177.86,
      "end": 180.42000000000002,
      "shot": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "strategy.",
      "start": 180.91,
      "end": 181.52,
      "shot": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "The next test is how much",
      "start": 181.52,
      "end": 182.95000000000002,
      "shot": 33
    },
    {
      "text": "useful computing this energy system can",
      "start": 183.04,
      "end": 185.65,
      "shot": 33
    },
    {
      "text": "deliver.",
      "start": 185.65,
      "end": 186.32000000000002,
      "shot": 33
    }
  ],
